  "title": "Fish Filet in Thai Coconut Curry Sauce",
  "description": "You can use any type of fish filet for this delicious curry dish like halibut, tilapia, or cod. I have also cooked chicken in the curry. Serve with plenty of rice.",
  "authors": [
    "Barbara Sauermann"
  ],
